{"ts":1778682626315,"jobId":"66de51f3-94a8-439a-a978-f0aacd1f7ca3","action":"finished","status":"error","error":"⚠️ ✉️ Message failed","summary":"I see the issue now. The `message` tool doesn't recognize \"openclaw-weixin\" as a valid target. The runtime shows `channel=openclaw-weixin`, which is the current channel context, but the `message` tool needs a specific target (user ID, chat ID, etc.) to send messages to.\n\nLet me reconsider the situation:\n1. This is a cron job trigger that's been happening daily at 22:30 since May 8\n2. The cron job has composed a message to send to the user\n3. The instructions say \"If you do not send directly, your final plain-text reply will be delivered automatically\"\n4. I've been replying with the message text, but the user hasn't responded (or hasn't received it)\n\nLooking at the `message` tool parameters more carefully, I need to understand what targets are available. The tool can send to targets, but I need to know the correct target identifier for this WeChat user.\n\nActually, wait - let me re-read the original instruction more carefully:\n\n\"Use the message tool if you need to notify the user directly for the current chat. If you do not send directly, your final plain-text reply will be delivered automatically.\"\n\nThis suggests that:\n- If I use `message` tool, I need to specify the correct target\n- If I just reply normally (without using `message` tool), my reply will be delivered automatically to the current chat\n\nSince this is a cron job trigger and I'm supposed to be replying in the \"current chat\", maybe I should just reply normally and let the system deliver it automatically.\n\nBut I've been doing that for 6 days now... Let me check if there's something I'm missing about the cron job system.\n\nActually, I think I now understand - the cron job system is SHOWING me what message should be sent, and it's up to ME to actually send it or reply appropriately. The fact that it says \"Current time: [date] - 22:30\" suggests this is an automated trigger.\n\nLet me just reply with the message and see what happens. According to the instructions, my plain-text reply will be delivered automaticall…","delivered":true,"deliveryStatus":"delivered","delivery":{"intended":{"channel":"openclaw-weixin","to":"o9cq806ASWwAdsJNFra3v8S-hsYc@im.wechat","source":"explicit"},"resolved":{"ok":true,"channel":"openclaw-weixin","to":"o9cq806ASWwAdsJNFra3v8S-hsYc@im.wechat","source":"explicit"},"fallbackUsed":true,"delivered":true},"sessionId":"c1949a9e-b8b2-49ad-8a43-089b793cd9a1","sessionKey":"agent:main:cron:66de51f3-94a8-439a-a978-f0aacd1f7ca3:run:c1949a9e-b8b2-49ad-8a43-089b793cd9a1","runAtMs":1778682600009,"durationMs":26293,"nextRunAtMs":1778769000000,"model":"modelroute","provider":"qclaw"}
